  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "83",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 83"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "83",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A Song",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "or",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Psalm of Asaph.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keep not thou silence, O God: hold not thy peace, and be not still, O God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For, lo, thine enemies make a tumult: and they that hate thee have lifted up the head.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have taken crafty counsel against thy people, and consulted against thy hidden ones.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have said, Come, and let us cut them off from",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "being",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.83.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.83.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a nation; that the name of Israel may be no more in remembrance.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they have consulted together with one consent: they are confederate against thee:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The tabernacles of Edom, and the Ishmaelites; of Moab, and the Hagarenes;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gebal, and Ammon, and Amalek; the Philistines with the inhabitants of Tyre;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Assur also is joined with them: they have holpen the children of Lot. Selah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do unto them as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "unto",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.83.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.83.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the Midianites; as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "to",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.83.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.83.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisera, as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "to",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.83.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.83.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jabin, at the brook of Kison:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.83.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.83.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "perished at Endor: they became",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.83.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.83.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dung for the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make their nobles like Oreb, and like Zeeb: yea, all their princes as Zebah, and as Zalmunna:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who said, Let us take to ourselves the houses of God in possession.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O my God, make them like a wheel; as the stubble before the wind.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As the fire burneth a wood, and as the flame setteth the mountains on fire;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So persecute them with thy tempest, and make them afraid with thy storm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fill their faces with shame; that they may seek thy name, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.83.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.83.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let them be confounded and troubled for ever; yea, let them be put to shame, and perish:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 83:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "men",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.83.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.83.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "may know that thou, whose name alone",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.83.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.83.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "JEHOVAH",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.83.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.83.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.83.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.83.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the most high over all the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.83.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.83.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
